# Domain-Driven Design

Use DDD principles pragmatically.

Do not introduce DDD patterns merely for ceremony.

## Domain concepts

Prefer explicit domain concepts over generic abstractions.

Examples:

- Opportunity
- District
- Region
- Inquiry
- Workflow
- SLA
- Investment Structure
- Sector


##Main Components
1 Investor onboarding & aftercare platform 
2 Certificates & anti-forgery verification (MVP) 
3 Investor-to-business matchmaking
4 External system integrations (ORC, GIS, payments)
5 AI assistant (chatbot) 
6 Internal automation & dashboards

